     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ValueSet BROutrosProfissionais</b></p><a name=\"BROutrosProfissionais\"> </a><a name=\"hcBROutrosProfissionais\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Perfil: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/shareablevalueset.html\">Shareable ValueSet</a></p></div><ul><li>Include estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"CodeSystem-BRConselhoProfissional.html\"><code>https://terminologia.saude.gov.br/fhir/CodeSystem/BRConselhoProfissional</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> versão ?1.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Definição</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-BRConselhoProfissional.html#BRConselhoProfissional-https.58.47.47saude.46gov.46br.47fhir.47sid.47crp-ac-ro\">https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/crp-ac-ro</a></td><td>CRP-AC-RO</td><td>Conselho Regional de Psicologia da 24ª Região (AC/RO).</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-BRConselhoProfissional.html#BRConselhoProfissional-https.58.47.47saude.46gov.46br.47fhir.47sid.47crp-al\">https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/crp-al</a></td><td>CRP-AL</td><td>Conselho Regional de Psicologia da 15ª Região (AL).</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-BRConselhoProfissional.html#BRConselhoProfissional-https.58.47.47saude.46gov.46br.47fhir.47sid.47crp-am-rr\">https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/crp-am-rr</a></td><td>CRP-AM-RR</td><td>Conselho Regional de Psicologia da 20ª Região (AM/RR).</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-BRConselhoProfissional.html#BRConselhoProfissional-https.58.47.47saude.46gov.46br.47fhir.47sid.47crp-ba\">https://saude.gov.br/fhir/sid/crp-ba</a></td>